# A SHACL 1.2 global rule (not attached through sh:rule): rejected in
# --shacl12 mode rather than silently skipped.
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
ex:n a ex:Thing .
ex:GlobalRule a sh:TripleRule ; sh:subject ex:n ; sh:predicate ex:p ; sh:object true .
